title: Mallin Ousted!
subtitle: Not even his blindly loyal party stands by him now.
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and gnu_formed and ((nationalists_staal >= 10 and industrialists_staal >= 8 and not press_censorship) or (nationalists_staal >= 8 and industrialists_staal >= 6 and press_censorship))
new-page: true
priority: 1
tags: event
max-visits: 1
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/dnvp_poster.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}
go-to: hugenberg_dnvp if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical"; hugenberg_dnf if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"

= Mallin Ousted

@hugenberg_dnvp

Initially, Mallin and his <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> initially stood to gain the most by backing the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> Goodryke cabinet. However, relations soured with the chancellery after Staal refused to grant him full control over the agricultural and economic ministries. His uncompromising opposition to Staal has sparked widespread discontent within the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, eroding Mallin’s once unchallenged authority among both party leaders and the rank-and-file.

Many find it bewildering that Mallin would oppose a fellow <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span>, especially one presumably sharing his goal of steering the Commonwealth toward authoritarian rule.

With internal party democracy long dead—party congresses stacked with loyalists serving as mere rubber stamps—dissenters have little choice. Now, the majority within the party are seizing Staal’s lifeline: the absorption of friendly <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalists</span> into the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span>, where they hope to finally gain a hand in shaping the chancellor's future policies.

- @schleicher_2_dnvp: The <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span> welcomes its new members.

@hugenberg_dnf

Mallin and the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>, once buoyed by their early popularity as one of the few parties to unconditionally back Goodryke, have since soured their relations with the chancellery. Mallin's demand for full control over the agricultural and economic ministries has strained ties, and his uncompromising opposition to Staal has sparked discontent within the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>—a party once built entirely from his loyalists.

Many of his former allies are now bewildered that Mallin would turn against a fellow <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span>, especially one who ostensibly shares his vision of steering the Commonwealth toward authoritarian rule.

With Mallin’s personal fortune—once sustained by his media empire—running dry, and industrial backers remaining firmly opposed to his leadership, frustrated members and former confidants are abandoning ship. They now flock to the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span>, preferring to back Staal directly without Mallin standing in their way.

- @schleicher_2_dnf: The <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span> welcomes its new members.

@schleicher_2_dnvp
go-to: schleicher_2_dnvp_post

With Staal’s backing, the dissident factions have been absorbed into the [? if not kvp_formed: newly revived <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>, which, at the chancellor’s urging, has become a <i>Rechtsblock</i> where all <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalists</span> can coalesce. ?][? if kvp_formed and kvp_gnu: <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>, which, at Staal’s urging, has become a <i>Rechtsblock</i> where all <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalists</span> can coalesce. ?][? if kvp_formed and not kvp_gnu: <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>, which has also been strong-armed into joining the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span>. ?]

What’s left of Mallin’s <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> is a shadow of its former self, and his sway on the national stage has all but vanished. But that man never gives up. [? if kvp_leader != "Trevannon": Trevannon has since been installed as leader of the now <i>bloc party</i>-aligned <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>. ?]

@schleicher_2_dnvp_post
on-arrival: {!
Q.kvp_gnu = 1;
Q.dufour_staal_r += 1;
Q.traditionalist_gnu_alt = 1;

Q.pro_republic -= 3;

if (!Q.kvp_formed) {
    Q.kvp_formed = 1;
    Q.staal_kvp = 1;
    Q.parties.push('kvp');
    Q.parties_graph.push('kvp');

    Q.commons_kvp = 3;
    Q.commons_traditionalist -= 3;

    Q.burgher_kvp = 8;
    Q.burgher_traditionalist -= 8;

    Q.guild_kvp = 12;
    Q.guild_traditionalist -= 12;

    Q.landed_kvp = 8;
    Q.landed_traditionalist -= 6;
    Q.landed_other -= 2;

    Q.disfavored_kvp = 0;

    Q.faithful_kvp = 4;
    Q.faithful_traditionalist -= 3;
    Q.faithful_other -= 1;

    Q.kvp_r = Math.round((Q.other_r*0.2) * 10) / 10 ;
    Q.other_r = Math.round((Q.other_r - Q.kvp_r) * 10) / 10 ;
    Q.kvp_r = Math.round((Q.kvp_r) * 10 / 10)
    Q.other_r = Math.round((Q.other_r) * 10 / 10)

    Q.kvp_r += Math.round((Q.traditionalist_r*0.6) * 10) / 10 ;
    Q.traditionalist_r = Math.round((Q.traditionalist_r - Q.kvp_r) * 10) / 10 ;
    Q.kvp_r = Math.round((Q.kvp_r) * 10 / 10)
    Q.traditionalist_r = Math.round((Q.traditionalist_r) * 10 / 10)

    Q.kvp_relation = 10;

    Q.kvp_leader = "Trevannon";
    Q.old_commons_kvp_display = 0;
    Q.old_burgher_kvp_display = 0;
    Q.old_guild_kvp_display = 0;
    Q.old_landed_kvp_display = 0;
    Q.old_disfavored_kvp_display = 0;
    Q.old_faithful_kvp_display = 0;

    for (var record of Q.election_records) {
        record['kvp'] = 0;
    }
    for (var record of Q.party_support_records) {
        record['kvp'] = 0;
    }
}
Q.gnu_relation -= 15;

Q.gnu_r += Q.kvp_r;
Q.kvp_r = 0;

Q.kvp_leader = "Trevannon";
!}

Current composition of the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span>:

[? if gnu_formed: - <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> ?]

[? if dstp_gnu: - <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> ?]

[? if lvp_gnu: - <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> ?]

[? if unionist_gnu: - <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> ?]

[? if unionist_gnu: - <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> ?]

[? if gold_gnu: - <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> ?]

[? if other_gnu: - **Others** ?]

[? if kvp_gnu: - <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span> ?]

[? if traditionalist_gnu: - <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> ?]

[? if nvf_gnu: - <span style="color: #142e20;">**NVF**</span> ?]

@schleicher_2_dnf
go-to: schleicher_2_dnf_post

With Staal’s backing, the dissident factions have been absorbed into the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, which has been "encouraged" to reform itself into a <i>Rechtsblock</i>[? if not traditionalist_gnu:, and strong-armed into joining the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span> as well?], firmly aligned with the Staal government.

Mallin is now left with his tiny <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>—no friends, no funds, and no influence on the national stage. There’s a strong chance he’ll give up entirely. But for now, he stubbornly clings on onto whatever influence he has left in his media empire. [? if traditionalist_leader != "Trevannon" and traditionalist_leader != "Lambach": Trevannon has since been installed as leader of the now <i>bloc party</i>-aligned <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>. ?]

@schleicher_2_dnf_post
on-arrival: {!
Q.traditionalist_gnu = 1;
Q.dufour_staal_r += 1;
Q.traditionalist_gnu_alt = 1;

Q.pro_republic -= 5;
Q.traditionalist_relation = (Q.gnu_relation - 35);

Q.commons_dnf -= 3;
Q.burgher_dnf -= 5;
Q.guild_dnf -= 5;
Q.landed_dnf -= 5;
Q.disfavored_dnf -= 5;
Q.faithful_dnf -= 3;

Q.commons_traditionalist += 3;
Q.burgher_traditionalist += 5;
Q.guild_traditionalist += 5;
Q.landed_traditionalist += 5;
Q.disfavored_traditionalist += 5;
Q.faithful_traditionalist += 3;

Q.gnu_relation -= 15;

Q.traditionalist_r = Math.round((Q.dnf_r*0.4) * 10) / 10 ;
Q.dnf_r = Math.round((Q.dnf_r*0.6) * 10) / 10 ;
Q.traditionalist_r = Math.round((Q.traditionalist_r) * 10 / 10)
Q.dnf_r = Math.round((Q.dnf_r) * 10 / 10)

Q.gnu_r += Q.traditionalist_r;
Q.traditionalist_r = 0;

if (Q.traditionalist_leader != "Lambach") Q.traditionalist_leader = "Trevannon";
!}

